    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53385" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρνος</span></b> , ὁ, (cf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρας</span>) expld. by <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόσκημα, πρόβατον</span>, i.e.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ram</i>:—hence
